WEBVTT

00:09:57.967 --> 00:10:01.116
Those connected elements
of our past campaigns

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:05.566
need to be kept in mind
by people striving to do the same today

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:07.507
for drinking water safety,

00:10:07.531 --> 00:10:09.879
antibiotic resistance deaths,

00:10:09.903 --> 00:10:12.521
criminal justice reform,

00:10:12.545 --> 00:10:15.135
risks from climate disruption,

00:10:15.159 --> 00:10:17.363
bio- and nanotech impacts,

00:10:17.387 --> 00:10:18.933
the nuclear arms race,

00:10:18.957 --> 00:10:20.115
peace treaties,

00:10:20.139 --> 00:10:21.477
dangers to children,

00:10:21.501 --> 00:10:23.640
chemical and radioactive perils,

00:10:23.664 --> 00:10:25.210
and the like.

00:10:25.234 --> 00:10:31.129
According to a solid study in 2016
by Johns Hopkins School of Medicine,